ew</p></div></div><div class="framer-1b3s4n5" data-framer-name="Icon"><div class="framer-1K87s framer-1210ugb" style="--43q7um:var(--token-3a3e7a9a-2a72-4fbe-a390-b316967e9bf8, rgb(255, 255, 255))"></div></div></a><!--/$--></div></div><!--/$--></div><div class="framer-fz67wu" data-framer-appear-id="fz67wu" data-framer-name="Thumbnail" style="opacity:0.001;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-v6n3bo"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" width="1232" height="928" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) min(100vw, 1120px), (max-width: 809.98px) min(100vw - 40px, 1120px), (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) min(100vw - 80px, 1120px)" srcset="http://localhost:8765/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/ylCY8IRoS3My83szasnPjBntSg_3987f10357.webp 512w,http://localhost:8765/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/ylCY8IRoS3My83szasnPjBntSg_43da1fcb84.webp 1024w,http://localhost:8765/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/ylCY8IRoS3My83szasnPjBntSg_2282892158.webp 1232w" src="http://localhost:8765/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/ylCY8IRoS3My83szasnPjBntSg_2282892158.webp" alt="Fashion photography of a young woman in a white dress standing under the green leaves of a tree" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="framer-f0ax6t" data-framer-name="Details"><div class="framer-q32ru6" data-framer-name="Content"><div class="framer-41c6tg" data-framer-name="Outcome"><svg class="framer-jwiil framer-h8v8m9" role="presentation" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#1210562455"/></svg><div class="framer-1eskpvd" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-tjbxn9" data-styles-preset="YuDVsSmtD" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-color:var(--token-5df59d0f-d876-4d90-804c-bbd4245cc8ac, rgb(32, 32, 32))">Increased conversion by 32% in the first month</p></div></div><div class="framer-xpyi3k" data-framer-name="Overview"><div class="framer-ra6bf2" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-jzbuj3" data-styles-preset="Yutt2aWJn" dir="auto">Overview</p></div><div class="framer-ptiso" data-framer-name="Overview" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">Nadina was created as a modern portfolio template designed to help creatives present their work with clarity and quiet confidence. The concept behind the template was to remove visual noise and allow the work itself to take the spotlight. By combining a calm aesthetic with a structured layout, Nadina provides a digital space where designers, developers, and creative professionals can showcase projects in a way that feels composed and intentional.</p><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ygewqv">The visual language of the template focuses on balance and restraint. Generous spacing, carefully chosen typography, and subtle interaction details create a browsing experience that feels smooth and focused. Each section is designed to guide visitors naturally, from introduction, to selected work, to deeper case studies without overwhelming them with unnecessary elements. The result is a portfolio environment that feels modern yet timeless, allowing the content to remain the primary focus.</p></div></div></div><div class="framer-axukpd" data-framer-name="Image Container"><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-9qirg9"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" width="1232" height="928" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) min(100vw, 1120px), (max-width: 809.98px) min(100vw - 40