portrait of a woman in flowing pink fabric, blending soft motion blur with warm pink and orange tones for a dreamy effect.",{"type":6,"value":94},"Verdan Core",{"type":6,"value":96},"A robust web platform engineered for performance and scalability, focusing on clean architecture and efficient front-end implementation.",{"type":6,"value":98},"verdan-core",{"type":6,"value":100},"J5TFrvtHN",["Map"]]</script><div id="svg-templates" style="position: absolute; overflow: hidden; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 0; height: 0; z-index: 0; contain: strict" aria-hidden="true">
